WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
You are going to be a junior this year too

2
00:00:01,720 --> 00:00:02,680
Then school starts for Rainbow Dash

3
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:03,840
I'm starting my senior year

4
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,240
Your younger son is in his first year of college

5
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:06,680
Linjing is indeed a junior

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,640
When Rainbow Dash arrives, will your mother and I wear it?

7
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:14,000
Rainbow Dash will not be a left-behind child

8
00:00:15,020 --> 00:00:16,460
Linjing and I did discuss it

9
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,700
We live near the school

10
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:18,860
Replace two flat floors

11
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:19,780
Not too big

12
00:00:19,780 --> 00:00:21,020
Four or five hundred square meters will do.

13
00:00:21,020 --> 00:00:21,940
Dehua is coming too

14
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,860
You pay

15
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:23,980
Who is Dehua?

16
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:29,900
It’s just Yun Qixing

17
00:00:30,260 --> 00:00:31,660
I'm a senior and don't have many classes

18
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:33,980
Linjing is indeed a little busy as an exchange student.

19
00:00:34,380 --> 00:00:38,780
Yunqi was born to take care of children, so we can’t waste it and we wear them in different ways.

20
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:40,900
Let the aunt come to clean the house every day

21
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,320
When you take care of your children

22
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:48,790
Don't complain that Rainbow Dash will do it when the time comes.

23
00:00:49,190 --> 00:00:50,110
Rainbow Dash is so good

24
00:00:51,700 --> 00:00:53,620
Baby, good baby

25
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:56,790
Baby, slow down
